<title>INDIA: Delhi shares drift lower ahead of settlement.</title>
<headline>Delhi shares drift lower ahead of settlement.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delhi shares quoted a shade lower in sluggish early trade as speculators booked profits ahead of Friday's settlement, brokers said.</p>
<p>The Delhi sensitive index was down 0.73 point at 799.75 after 30 minutes of trade.  </p>
<p>&quot;Slack buying interest coupled with profit-taking arrested the rise in stock prices,&quot; said B.K. Nagpal of brokers B.B. Portfolio.</p>
<p>Reliance Industries gained 1.50 rupees to 312.35.</p>
<p>State Bank of India fell one rupee to 318.</p>
<p>ACC lost 17.25 rupees to 1,151.</p>
<p>TELCO was down 1.20 rupees at 403.</p>
<p>TISCO quoted 0.50 rupee lower at 174.25.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
